    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "NITI Aayog was established on January 1, 2015, replacing the 65-year-old Planning Commission.",
        "The Prime Minister serves as the ex-officio Chairperson of both NITI Aayog and formerly the Planning Commission.",
        "Distinction between Top-Down planning (Planning Commission) and Bottom-Up planning (NITI Aayog) is frequently tested."
      ],
